flowchart TD
    A[Workflow called] --> B{Static data has token?<br/>& expires_at > now + 60s}
    B -->|yes| C[Return cached token]
    B -->|no| D[Build Basic Auth header]
    D --> E[GET /oauth/v1/generate]
    E -->|200| F[Parse access_token<br/>+ compute expires_at]
    F --> G[Store in static data]
    G --> H[Return fresh token]
    E -->|error| X[Clear cache<br/>throw error]

